  partName: Fastener
  description: The Fastener is a complex-shaped, tiny component positioned at the
    top-center-center of the engine, serving as a general-purpose fastening element
    for various engine parts. Composed of Material.001, it exhibits excellent strength
    and resistance to corrosion. Notably, its complex shape enables it to be used
    in a wide range of applications, from securing small components to assembling
    larger engine modules.
